.Dd November 11, 2026
.Dt NULLD 8
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm nulld
.Nd RavenBSD null device server
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
registers the
.Dq null:
scheme.
Every read is end-of-file (zero bytes); writes are accepted and discarded.
The file mode reported by
.Dv FSTAT
is a character device with mode 0666.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/services.d -compact
.It Pa /etc/services.d/nulld.toml
Service manifest.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr zerod 8 ,
.Xr randd 8 ,
.Xr init 8
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
